  "_comment": "The release bundle: the ONLY input to clean-room acceptance and the only thing shipped. static files are hashed into the manifest; rendered files are re-rendered from the manifest by every verifier; generated_at_install are the only files an install may add. Anything else in an install or bundle directory fails verify-bundle / verify-install.",
